Under `--modular-termination`, `dafny resolve`, `dafny doc`, `dafny extract` and `dafny format` now take `--solver-path`, as `dafny verify` and `dafny audit` do. Admitting a library checks the Z3 binary that verified it, and these commands could only find Z3 by the default search, so on a machine with a second Z3 binary they refused a library that `dafny verify --solver-path` admits (https://github.com/erniecohen/dafny/issues/358).
